before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
class Counter {
    int value = 0;
    void increment() { value++; }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Counter a = new Counter();
        Counter b = new Counter();
        b.increment();
        System.out.println(a.value + " " + b.value);
    }
}

```

after:
Track a and b as separate objects, each with its own count.

